      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of phantom limb pain, which had not successfully responded to a long list of medical therapy or neurosurgery, is presented. After oral ketamine treatment was instituted the patient became free of pain. A possible mode of action is described."},
